Create `src/main.js` - the top-level entry point that wires all systems together and runs the game loop.

This file imports from all previously created modules and starts the game.

## Startup sequence:

1. Wait for DOMContentLoaded
2. Read CONFIG from config.js; if CONFIG.SEED === 0, set a random seed: Math.floor(Math.random() * 86400)
3. Get canvas from document (or create one full-viewport)
4. Create scene context via createScene(canvas)
5. Create materials via createMaterials()
6. Create lighting via createLighting(scene.scene), store returned lightGeometry
7. Create worldGen via createWorldGen(seed)
8. Create worldManager via createWorldManager(scene.scene, worldGen, materials, lightingAPI, CONFIG)
9. Create player via createPlayer(scene.camera, CONFIG)
10. Create collision system via createCollisionSystem(worldManager, CONFIG)
11. Set player start position: find the centre of tile (0,0) - i.e. (TILE_WORLD_SIZE/2, PLAYER_HEIGHT, TILE_WORLD_SIZE/2)
12. Do an initial world update at start position (pre-warm the tile cache)
13. Update seed display in DOM: document.getElementById('seed-display').textContent = seedToTimeString(seed)

## Game loop (requestAnimationFrame):

```
let lastTime = 0;
function loop(timestamp) {
  const dt = Math.min((timestamp - lastTime) / 1000, 0.05);  // cap at 50ms
  lastTime = timestamp;

  // 1. Update world (load/unload tiles around player)
  const pos = player.getPosition();
  worldManager.update(pos.x, pos.z);

  // 2. Update player (movement + apply collision)
  player.update(dt, (p) => collisionSystem.resolveCollision(p, scene.scene));

  // 3. Render
  scene.renderer.render(scene.scene, scene.camera);

  requestAnimationFrame(loop);
}
requestAnimationFrame(loop);
```

## HUD stats update (every 30 frames):
- Update tile count, player position display
- Show FPS: track rolling average of last 30 dt values

## Overlay:
- Create a full-screen div with id='overlay' showing 'CLICK TO EXPLORE' in VT323 or monospace
- Style: black bg, yellow text, centred, disappears on pointer lock
- Add a small subtitle: current seed as HH:MM:SS, 'LEVEL 0', 'NON-EUCLIDEAN SPACE'

VERIFICATION:
